creen text, no subtitles, no captions, no watermark, no graphics. A-Tao\n(S1), a teenage girl, on screen, bright voice, fast pace, rising endings with\na rustic accent, says in a feigned angry tone: <d>[Chinese] 好啊你，又偷偷摘我家桃子！</d>\noverall_soundscape: Wind moves through the leaves overhead in a soft papery\nrustle. A few birds answer each other beyond the fence, insects tick in the\ngrass, and something loose creaks once in the breeze.\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A\n\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 36, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 8, "widgets_values_named": {"prompt": "The target video starts from the given first frame at the 0.00-second mark: the\nopening composition is exactly that frame and must not jump away from it.\nHow the reference pictures are used — Picture 1 is a location reference only:\nit never appears as a frame, it just locks the place — keep the peach tree, the\nfence, the cottage and the afternoon light consistent with it for the entire\nclip. Picture 2 is a character reference only: it never appears as a frame,\nit just locks how the two characters look.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description:\n[Shot 1] A medium shot under the peach tree on a sunny farm afternoon. A-Tao\nplants both hands on her hips, lifts her chin, and leans her upper body forward\ntoward A-Qing, shoulders tight. A-Qing keeps his hands behind his back, slides\nhis right toe a little to the right, eyes fixed on her, a smile pressed at the\ncorner of his mouth. She leans a little further, lips parting slightly. The\nvideo starts exactly from the first frame, and the camera pushes in with small\namplitude at slow speed toward A-Tao's forward-leaning upper body, tightening\nthe confrontation. Photorealistic cinematic footage, natural motivated\nlighting, shallow depth of field, fine film grain, stable framing. Do not\nsettle or freeze at the end; the action is still in progress on the last frame.\nEvery character keeps exactly the same facial features, hairstyle, hair colour,\nbuild and costume as in Picture 2 for the entire clip, without drifting or\ndeforming. The location stays consistent with Picture 1 throughout. No\non-screen text, no subtitles, no captions, no watermark, no graphics. A-Tao\n(S1), a teenage girl, on screen, bright voice, fast pace, rising endings with\na rustic accent, says in a feigned angry tone: <d>[Chinese] 好啊你，又偷偷摘我家桃子！</d>\noverall_soundscape: Wind moves through the leaves overhead in a soft papery\nrustle. A few birds answer each other beyond the fence, insects tick in the\ngrass, and something loose creaks once in the breeze.\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A\n\n"}}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [60], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "links": [], "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [261.4506299724774, 326], "pos": [388.89540368234236, 1101.5218696107956], "widgets_values": ["d79e489f78b8d58454e878971ec8d08565033d5dcff870f7838f03579864bdc0.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 42, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 9, "widgets_values_named": {"image": "d79e489f78b8d58454e878971ec8d08565033d5dcff870f7838f03579864bdc0.png", "upload": "image"}}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [63], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}], "size": [312.530859375, 130], "pos": [365.2300071787724, 918.0481675489452], "widgets_values": ["lanczos